# Backend (Firebase)

**Live now (client SDK):**
- Auth: Google sign-in via `utils/AuthContext.jsx` + `lib/firebaseClient.js`
- Projects: `users/{uid}/projects/{crmType}` — see `lib/projectsApi.js`
- Entity CRUD helpers: nested `users/{uid}/projects/{crmType}/{entity}/{docId}`
- Workspace UI: `/workspace` · Login modal on Agency `DynamicIslandNav`

**Env:** `FIREBASE_*` in `.env.local` (bridged to `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` in `next.config.js`). Restart after changes.

**Firestore rules:** deploy `firestore.rules` (user can only R/W their own `users/{uid}/**`).

**Still demo / not wired:**
- Most CRM list pages still use in-memory `CrmDataContext` seed data — call `projectsApi` entity methods when swapping a module to live data
- Payments (Polar / Dodo) — not started

**Do not** add Supabase unless asked. Prefer extending `lib/projectsApi.js` + `CrmDataContext` swap per entity.
